+ * the cartridge pads a Mail_c's. The board hands it to the address book and
+ * the editor instead of its Mail_c's body (m_board_ovl.c), the editor takes
+ * it in lines of 32 characters (mHandbill_EN_EDIT_LINE_LEN) and lays it out
+ * by width; when the letter is finished its first 96 bytes go into the
+ * letter and the rest into the extension, under the letter's key
+ * (mHandbill_en_BoardSent).
