+/* The address book's first balloon (ovl__00792700, func_8088B9F4_jp): an addressee to choose, or the
+ * book is empty. The cartridge centres its 12 characters (144 pixels: x - 72 to x + 72) in the balloon;
+ * the GameCube's strings are as long as they need (its own balloon, its own offsets), so each is
+ * centred there too, and narrowed to the cartridge's 144 pixels when it is wider. Drawn here because
+ * the overlay cannot grow. */
+#define mSM_EN_AD_TEXT_W 144
